{"step_index":680,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-19T17:28:49Z","content":"The UI has been upgraded with a **futuristic cyber-industrial command center** aesthetic:\n\n### 1. Futuristic Visual Styling & Theme\n- **Cyber Dark Canvas**: Deep obsidian theme (`#050711`) with subtle radial illumination mesh (cyan, purple, emerald accents).\n- **Glassmorphic HUD Containers**: Semi-transparent card panels with subtle glowing cyan borders (`rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.16)`), backdrop blur filters (`16px`), and depth lighting.\n- **Futuristic Typography**: Integrated geometric tech fonts (`Orbitron` for headers, `Rajdhani` for labels/cards, and `JetBrains Mono` for coordinates and telemetry data).\n\n### 2. Live Telemetry & Command HUD\n- **Real-Time System Status**: Added live pulsating status indicator dots (`@keyframes pulse_glow`) for live neural and telemetry feeds.\n- **Top Command Telemetry Strip**: High-tech HUD telemetry bar displaying:\n  - `NEURAL INFERENCE: GRAD-CAM ACTIVE`\n  - `TOC CAPACITY ENGINE: MULTI-STAGE ARMORED`\n  - `SIMULATION PROTOCOL: ARENA v16.2 COMPATIBLE`\n  - `SYSTEM ONLINE (LEVEL-4 AI | 12ms LATENCY)`\n\n### 3. Cyberpunk Plotly Charts & Data Visuals\n- **Neon Palette**: Upgraded all chart visualizations in [`utils/chart_helpers.py`](file:///C:/Users/win-10/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/neurax_app/utils/chart_helpers.py) with electric cyan (`#00f0ff`), cyber emerald (`#05df9d`), neon crimson (`#ff3366`), and ultraviolet (`#bf5af2`).\n- **Subtle Grid Meshes**: Clean coordinate gridlines with crisp contrast for high-density inspection logs.\n\n### 4. Interactive Elements\n- **Glowing Cyber Tabs & Buttons**: Floating tab segments with neon underlines and cyber button hover effects.\n- **Target Reticles**: Bounding boxes in the gallery feature HUD corner brackets and high-contrast telemetry tags."}
